      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know they both make you sleepy but i've heard people mix them all the time and be fine. i'm not looking to get high or anything, i just really need to sleep so i can go to work tomorrow. isn't it like a pretty common thing to do if you just take a small dose of the benadryl? it seems like a minor thing compared to the actual pain i'm in.",
