      "content": "Hearing anecdotes from others does not change the medical risks, as interactions between combinations like this can severely impact your individual physiology without warning signs. Even a small dose of benadryl can add significantly to the sedative effects of hydrocodone, increasing the danger of falls, accidents at work, or dangerous breathing suppression. Please do not mix these medications together; taking an alternate night of benadryl with skipping your pain medication is also unsafe, so you must speak with a healthcare provider about safer options to manage your pain and insomnia.",
